{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线第一下落在上半屏左侧的大号高亮白色文字，尤其是段首第一行；右上角目录和下方音符动画明显是次要入口。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他正在担心对方有一天不再需要自己陪伴，甚至觉得和自己相处也不自在。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"没底、不安、害怕被嫌弃，也有一点忐忑。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他想起对方一直没有退开、两人目前仍然亲近，因此又有一点高兴；这份不安并没有消失，只是暂时不再占据全部心思。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"单块文字很长，里面连续包含担忧、现实中的亲近、短暂的高兴、情绪回落和音乐意象，后续层次需要继续阅读才能理解。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "649827ed-1d08-4d16-82b1-85143d599e66", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T014232372040Z", "elapsed_seconds": 48.062, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:43:20.441606+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bf6a95e95b0fd0b58fc9a42dd4bd64423a6968cd3ad6c6cd6c42e60e8be1ffbe", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f458